{
 "duration": 95.16,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "c1",
   "text": "One. The pre-order.",
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 1.547
  },
  {
   "id": "l1",
   "text": "In four days, Grand Theft Auto Six launches on PlayStation Five and Xbox Series X and S.",
   "start": 1.867,
   "end": 6.939
  },
  {
   "id": "l2",
   "text": "Sensor Tower estimates digital pre-orders have already passed a billion dollars. Take-Two hasn't confirmed that number. But its CEO says pre-orders are running far in excess of expectations.",
   "start": 7.259,
   "end": 17.723
  },
  {
   "id": "l3",
   "text": "And it isn't cheap. Seventy-nine ninety-nine for the standard edition. Ninety-nine ninety-nine for the Ultimate.",
   "start": 18.043,
   "end": 23.638
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "text": "Two. The budget.",
   "start": 23.958,
   "end": 25.012
  },
  {
   "id": "l4",
   "text": "Nobody outside Rockstar knows what it cost. Rockstar told Bloomberg it was not quite as much as the Burj Khalifa, a building estimated at one and a half billion dollars.",
   "start": 25.332,
   "end": 34.144
  },
  {
   "id": "l5",
   "text": "Rockstar now has more than four thousand seven hundred employees. Nearly double the headcount from when work began.",
   "start": 34.464,
   "end": 40.078
  },
  {
   "id": "l6",
   "text": "That's a bet you only make with a hit behind you. The series has sold half a billion copies. GTA Five alone, more than two hundred and thirty million.",
   "start": 40.398,
   "end": 48.174
  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "text": "Three. The quarter.",
   "start": 48.494,
   "end": 49.636
  },
  {
   "id": "l7",
   "text": "Take-Two needs this. In the three months to September, its net bookings fell eighteen percent, to one point six billion dollars.",
   "start": 49.956,
   "end": 56.593
  },
  {
   "id": "l8",
   "text": "For October to December, it's guiding three point three five to three point five billion. More than double. Mostly on one game.",
   "start": 56.913,
   "end": 63.512
  },
  {
   "id": "l9",
   "text": "The CEO, Strauss Zelnick, is careful about it. Quote: we tend to avoid claiming success before it occurs.",
   "start": 63.832,
   "end": 69.54
  },
  {
   "id": "c4",
   "text": "Four. What to watch.",
   "start": 69.861,
   "end": 71.082
  },
  {
   "id": "l10",
   "text": "Three things on launch day. Whether Xbox cloud streaming holds up when it opens at one A.M. Eastern. The thirty frames per second target on both consoles. And whether pre-orders turn into real sales.",
   "start": 71.401,
   "end": 82.344
  },
  {
   "id": "l11",
   "text": "Then the long game. Bloomberg reports GTA Online earned around half a billion dollars a year for GTA Five. The online mode for Six comes later.",
   "start": 82.664,
   "end": 90.658
  },
  {
   "id": "out",
   "text": "That's the money behind the biggest launch of the year. Save your game.",
   "start": 90.978,
   "end": 94.34
  }
 ],
